    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, Relax, and Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where driving is not just a means to an end but an experience in itself. In this game, you take the wheel and immerse yourself in serene landscapes to the sound of a carefully curated lo-fi soundtrack designed to bring calm and tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.poster.avif?t=1746502184\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.webm?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.mp4?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether exploring an open world filled with winding roads, hills, forests, and charming small towns, or tackling the infinite road where every mile is a new chance to relax and lose yourself in thought, this game is your perfect digital retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Free Exploration &amp; Infinite Road</strong> \u2013 Feel free to forge your path or challenge yourself with an endless journey where the horizon is your only limit.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive Lo-Fi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Let relaxing music set the perfect atmosphere to unwind.<br>\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong> \u2013 Experience the beauty of dynamic environments with subtle light changes throughout the day, offering unique scenery with every drive.<br>\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Calm &amp; Introspective Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Designed to soothe, perfect for moments when you need to breathe deeply and enjoy the present.<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Simple &amp; Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy-to-use controls let you focus on the experience, providing a seamless and immersive drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.poster.avif?t=1746502184\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.webm?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.mp4?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no timers, no urgent missions. Just you, the road, and the music. If you\u2019re looking for a game to slow down, find inner peace, and simply enjoy the ride, this is your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones, start the engine, and let the road guide you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, Relax, and Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where driving is not just a means to an end but an experience in itself. In this game, you take the wheel and immerse yourself in serene landscapes to the sound of a carefully curated lo-fi soundtrack designed to bring calm and tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.poster.avif?t=1746502184\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.webm?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/68333ffb434852f9c352b9c5bb1fb41d.mp4?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether exploring an open world filled with winding roads, hills, forests, and charming small towns, or tackling the infinite road where every mile is a new chance to relax and lose yourself in thought, this game is your perfect digital retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Free Exploration &amp; Infinite Road</strong> \u2013 Feel free to forge your path or challenge yourself with an endless journey where the horizon is your only limit.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive Lo-Fi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Let relaxing music set the perfect atmosphere to unwind.<br>\ud83c\udf05 <strong>Stunning Landscapes</strong> \u2013 Experience the beauty of dynamic environments with subtle light changes throughout the day, offering unique scenery with every drive.<br>\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Calm &amp; Introspective Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Designed to soothe, perfect for moments when you need to breathe deeply and enjoy the present.<br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Simple &amp; Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy-to-use controls let you focus on the experience, providing a seamless and immersive drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.poster.avif?t=1746502184\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.webm?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385300/extras/1aae844f96ecca6a42f66c57a288f231.mp4?t=1746502184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no timers, no urgent missions. Just you, the road, and the music. If you\u2019re looking for a game to slow down, find inner peace, and simply enjoy the ride, this is your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones, start the engine, and let the road guide you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Drive through serene landscapes to the sound of relaxing lo-fi. Choose to explore a vast open world or follow an endless road, with no rush, no limits. With stunning graphics, simple controls, and a calm atmosphere, this is the perfect game to relax and enjoy the journey.",
